          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jul 30 2019 19:01:29 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">When it comes to infection, the numbers tell the story. Every year in the U.S. over 700,000 patients acquire healthcare-associated infections.<sup>1&nbsp;</sup>In 2018, the ECRI listed device cleaning, disinfection <g class=\"gr_ gr_6 gr-alert gr_gramm gr_inline_cards gr_disable_anim_appear Punctuation only-ins replaceWithoutSep\" id=\"6\" data-gr-id=\"6\">and</g> sterilization in their list of Top 10 Patient Safety Concerns for Healthcare Organizations report.&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 01 2019 19:22:38 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
